A lineage narrowed where package fleet uses it: the narrowing refers to a
definition in another package of the module and to nothing of the lineage's,
and is admitted however it is applied, since the unification happens outside
the lineage's text (#238). The narrowed use is a lineage of its own, and its
schema digests cover the narrowing.
-- normal.cue --
name: "ship"
schemas: "0": "0": schema: {authorization?: =~"^Bearer "}
-- narrowing.cue --
import "example.com/fleet/common"

{joinSchema: common.#Headers & {"content-type"?: "application/json"}}
-- common/common.cue --
package common

#Headers: {[=~"^[a-z-]+$"]: string, ...}
-- out/verdict --
# bind
ok
# ids
0.0 g1.bddfdd419c4f885cf41bd0339d3144052ef3c207817cff8c1d9c3bd2a734e6e9:g1.44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a
